  <div class="container content-split">
    <div class="fade-up">
      <span class="eyebrow">Why Grafting Matters</span>
      <h2 id="why-graft-heading">Bone Loss Is Progressive — and Preventable</h2>
      <span class="gold-rule"></span>
      <p>When a tooth is removed, the jawbone that supported it begins to shrink. Within the first year, significant volume can be lost. Without enough bone, an implant cannot be placed safely.</p>
      <p>Bone grafting restores that volume — using bone graft material to stimulate the body's own healing and regeneration. Once the graft has integrated, implant placement can proceed on a solid foundation.</p>
    </div>
